ies general information in short written or spoken conversations."}, {"type": "secondary_6", "content": "Identifies general information in short written or spoken conversations."}, {"type": "secondary_7", "content": "Identifies general information in short written or spoken conversations."}, {"type": "secondary_8", "content": "Identifies general information in short written or spoken conversations."}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Using Modals to Express Suggestions"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "You can use the modals <span class=\"italic\"> can, could, may, might, shall</span> and <span class=\"italic\">should </span> to express suggestions."}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":2,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Modal\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Example\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">can<br> could<br> may<br> might<br> shall<br> should</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">We can hop a flight to Berlin!<br> You could go to Amsterdam.<br> You may enjoy the architecture there.<br> You might want to visit the museum.<br> Shall we go to the art gallery?<br> I should visit the Palace.<br></span>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" instruction_table_background intro_table_border\"}"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Responding to Suggestions"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "When you respond to a friend's suggestion, the response can be positive or negative."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Suggestion: You may enjoy looking at the baroque architecture."}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":2,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Negative Response\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Positive Response\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">Architecture?<br> Boring!<br> That's boring!<br> I don't think so.<br> Are you sure?</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">That's a great idea!<br> Thanks for the help.<br> I'd like that!<br> Thanks for the suggestion!<br> I'm sure I would.</span>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "soprano "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a singer with a high voice "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: The soloist in the opera is a soprano."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le10ob02aud01"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "These are words you use when you talk about Salzburg."}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "bored "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "not interested "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Some people are bored at the opera."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le10ob02aud02"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "baroque "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "reflecting 17th and 18th century European style "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Salzburg has a great deal of baroque architecture."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le10ob02aud03"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "I'm not into ... "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "I don't like; I'm not interested in"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(expression)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I'm not into opera."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le10ob02aud04"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to hop "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to jump a short distance; take a short plane ride"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: In Europe, you can quickly hop to another city."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le10ob02aud05"}]}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "engenn4le10ob02re1img01.jpg"}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Find a city online that you want to visit."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Choose 3 things to do there."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Write about the things you want to do."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Say what you can do there."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Say why you want to go."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Tell a partner about your choices."}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "I do research online about a city."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I write about things to do in a city."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I read my sentences to a partner."}]}]}